{"prosotype_text": "0.1", "profile": "16a", "text": "I wasn't sure about the trip at first.\nThe weather looked terrible all week.\nAnd we'd already cancelled twice.\nBut on Saturday morning the sky cleared.\nSo we packed the car and drove up the coast.\nWe stopped for coffee in a tiny town with one street and a bakery that sold out by 9.\nBy the afternoon we were walking along the cliffs.\nWatching the waves crash below us.\nHonestly.\nIt was the best day I've had in months.\nAnd I can't wait to go back.", "utterances": [[[0, 1], [2, 8], [9, 13], [14, 19], [20, 23], [24, 28], [29, 31], [32, 38]], [[39, 42], [43, 50], [51, 57], [58, 66], [67, 70], [71, 76]], [[77, 80], [81, 85], [86, 93], [94, 103], [104, 110]], [[111, 114], [115, 117], [118, 126], [127, 134], [135, 138], [139, 142], [143, 151]], [[152, 154], [155, 157], [158, 164], [165, 168], [169, 172], [173, 176], [177, 182], [183, 185], [186, 189], [190, 196]], [[197, 199], [200, 207], [208, 211], [212, 218], [219, 221], [222, 223], [224, 228], [229, 233], [234, 238], [239, 242], [243, 249], [250, 253], [254, 255], [256, 262], [263, 267], [268, 272], [273, 276], [277, 279], [280, 282]], [[283, 285], [286, 289], [290, 299], [300, 302], [303, 307], [308, 315], [316, 321], [322, 325], [326, 333]], [[334, 342], [343, 346], [347, 352], [353, 358], [359, 364], [365, 368]], [[369, 378]], [[379, 381], [382, 385], [386, 389], [390, 394], [395, 398], [399, 403], [404, 407], [408, 410], [411, 418]], [[419, 422], [423, 424], [425, 430], [431, 435], [436, 438], [439, 441], [442, 447]]]}
